    "reason": "The defect is the painted position of a dropdown caret relative to its select box. It is a product of stylesheet cascade and absolute positioning resolved by the browser's layout engine, so an assertion would have to restate the layout engine's own arithmetic rather than observe the misplacement."
  },
  "fix_commit": "c7ea21da9ba6ef473796a438ec5f3c0a141c3f14",
