    "body_normalized": "## Description\nThe dropdown icon is misaligned when the screen size is small ( when the dropdown appears after clicking the ellipse )\n\n<img width=\"649\" height=\"143\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a025ff1f-94b2-405f-9a4c-5cad4152f14a\" />\n\n## Reproduce\n1. Reduce the screen size\n2. Click on the ellipse to show the actionable items\n3. Notice the misalignment\n\n## Expected behavior\nAligned as it normally is\n\n<img width=\"746\" height=\"143\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fab9972-6767-423a-a720-dd2f8e72f6ee\" />\n\n## Context\ncame up while working/testing https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/18282",
